Whirlpool Legacy integration

This integration includes modified portions of the Whirlpool integration in
Home Assistant Core (https://github.com/home-assistant/core), distributed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original Home Assistant contributors retain
their rights. Changes in this standalone integration include additional laundry
controls, local Favorites, Specialty-cycle support, and related documentation.

The custom_components/whirlpool Python platforms, config flow, entity helpers, and
associated integration metadata and translations are adapted from Home
Assistant Core where applicable. Modified Python files carry source notices.

The separately installed whirlpool-sixth-sense library is not included in this
repository. It is maintained at https://github.com/aevans0001/whirlpool-legacy-library
and has its own MIT license and attribution to its original contributors.
